      <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:12px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:2px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(143,208,234,0.18);color:#E7B98C;border:1px solid rgba(143,208,234,0.3);">Service Area</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);margin:0 0 18px;">Garage Building in Airdrie, Alberta</h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Airdrie's newer subdivisions often have a rear lane and a front attached garage that is already full. A detached back-lane garage is the usual way to add room, and two or three written quotes, gathered early, make the decision easier.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
        <a href="tel:+14035550162" class="btn-cream">Call Now — (403) 555-0162</a>
        <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline-white">Get a Written Quote</a>
